# Interactive Keynote Engine 🎭

### Fast, Minimalist Slide Decks from Plain Markdown in ViewMD

- **Native `.mdp` & `.deck` Engine**: Keynote aesthetics with zero compilation
- **6 Keynote Color Themes**: Midnight, Tokyo Night, Mocha, Paper, Daylight, Obsidian
- **Presenter Tools**: Laser Pointer (<kbd>L</kbd>), Slide Pen (<kbd>P</kbd>), Whiteboard (<kbd>W</kbd>)
- **16:9 PDF Export**: Instant print engine with no watermarks

<!-- note: Welcome to sample2.mdp! Use arrow keys to navigate slides. -->

