# Split Layout: Right Directive

![Modern Workspace](https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517694712202-14dd9538aa97?w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop "right")

### Effortless 50/50 Multi-Column Media

Using `![Alt](url "right")`, ViewMD automatically transforms your slide into a balanced 2-column keynote layout:

- **Left Column**: Markdown content, headings, checklists, and code snippets
- **Right Column**: Edge-to-edge media fitting with high visual contrast
- **Responsive Resizing**: Scales seamlessly to any screen resolution

