# Split Layout: Left Directive

![Neon Cyber City](https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509198397868-475647b2a1e5?w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop "left")

### Inverted Visual Balance

Using `![Alt](url "left")`, media anchors to the left column:

- Natural for step-by-step walkthroughs, diagram references, and code walk-throughs
- Fluid responsive typography
- Fully compatible with CodeMirror inline code blocks

