# Full-Bleed Background Directive

![Starlit Mountain Peak](https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop "bg opacity:0.25")

## Hero Slides with Custom Opacity

- Use `![Alt](url "bg opacity:0.25")` to set a cinematic fullscreen slide backdrop
- Text readability is preserved with automated contrast blending
- Opacity modifier ranges from `0.05` to `0.9`

