# Presenter Toolkit & Navigation 🧰

### Keyboard Shortcuts Built for Live Demos

| Key | Presenter Action |
| :---: | :--- |
| <kbd>F</kbd> | Toggle Fullscreen Presentation Mode |
| <kbd>L</kbd> | Toggle glowing trailing Laser Pointer (1s auto-fade) |
| <kbd>P</kbd> | Toggle persistent Slide Pen drawing annotation tool |
| <kbd>Ctrl+Z</kbd> / <kbd>Ctrl+Y</kbd> | Undo / Redo pen strokes on current slide |
| <kbd>W</kbd> | Toggle full Whiteboard canvas (powered by tldraw) |
| <kbd>O</kbd> | Slide Overview Grid with fuzzy slide filtering |
| <kbd>?</kbd> | Open MDP Syntax Reference modal |

